extends RefCounted
## Material library. Materials are cached and shared.
## Textures are looked up at res://textures/<name>_albedo.png, _normal.png, _rough.png
## (generated by tools/gen_textures.py). Missing textures fall back to flat PBR colour.
##
## Usage: Mats.get_mat("brick")  /  Mats.get_mat("brick", 2.0)  (uv scale in metres per tile)

